# SMS save round trip on the RTL core: a game-path nvram burst dirties the
# battery RAM, the 2 s debounce flushes it into saves/sms/game.sav (64 blocks
# = 32768 bytes) through the real iosys save engine and the on-chip dpram
# (dual port: the dump never pauses the game), a power cycle wipes the FPGA,
# and the reload restores the same bytes from the file into the RTL nvram.
expect-screen "TangCore"
press down
press down
press down
press down
press b
expect-screen "game.sms"
press down
press a
expect-overlay off
expect-core smstang
expect-save-ram 0x00 0xFF
wram-burst 0x000 512 0xA5
expect-file saves/sms/game.sav size 32768
power-cycle
expect-screen "TangCore"
press down
press down
press down
press down
press b
expect-screen "game.sms"
press down
press a
expect-overlay off
expect-save-ram 0x00 0xA5
expect-save-ram 0x01 0xA6
expect-save-ram 0x1FF 0xA4
expect-save-ram 0x1000 0xFF
